<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Dictionary Key="8a22b8e8-dca5-4733-9b2b-e8a2645a0ac3" Alias="Health.Consent.Use" Level="1">
  <Info>
    <Parent>Health</Parent>
  </Info>
  <Translations>
    <Translation Language="en-US">We use them only to book and provide the care you asked for. We store them encrypted, and only the staff of the practice that sees you can access them. You can withdraw this authorization at any time from your portal; withdrawing it does not erase what the law requires us to keep in your medical record.</Translation>
    <Translation Language="es-CO">Los usamos sólo para agendar y prestarte la atención que pediste. Los guardamos cifrados, y sólo los ve el personal del consultorio que te atiende. Puedes retirar esta autorización cuando quieras desde tu portal; retirarla no borra lo que la ley obliga a conservar de tu historia clínica.</Translation>
  </Translations>
</Dictionary>
